    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chopping Hour is a first-person psychological horror game in which you manage a seemingly ordinary meat restaurant during the day, and struggle to survive in a dark and dangerous atmosphere at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the daytime, you prepare meals for customers and try to fulfill their orders. But when night comes, the same restaurant takes on a threatening atmosphere. A mysterious entity roams inside, and each night becomes more difficult than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restaurant-focused systems like cooking, ordering ingredients, placing products on shelves, and customer satisfaction are combined with horror mechanics such as hiding, escaping, and being alert. These two different gameplay styles gradually blend together to create increasingly tense and complex moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Restaurant management by day, survival horror by night  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Dynamic time cycle  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Ingredient management, order fulfillment, and cooking systems  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Hiding, light usage, and escape-based mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Rich atmosphere and immersive sound design  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Growing psychological tension as the story progresses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chopping Hour aims to make the player feel not only the pressure of food service, but also the psychological weight of a place that changes with the night. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chopping Hour is a first-person psychological horror game in which you manage a seemingly ordinary meat restaurant during the day, and struggle to survive in a dark and dangerous atmosphere at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the daytime, you prepare meals for customers and try to fulfill their orders. But when night comes, the same restaurant takes on a threatening atmosphere. A mysterious entity roams inside, and each night becomes more difficult than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restaurant-focused systems like cooking, ordering ingredients, placing products on shelves, and customer satisfaction are combined with horror mechanics such as hiding, escaping, and being alert. These two different gameplay styles gradually blend together to create increasingly tense and complex moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Restaurant management by day, survival horror by night  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Dynamic time cycle  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Ingredient management, order fulfillment, and cooking systems  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Hiding, light usage, and escape-based mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Rich atmosphere and immersive sound design  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Growing psychological tension as the story progresses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chopping Hour aims to make the player feel not only the pressure of food service, but also the psychological weight of a place that changes with the night. </p>",
    "short_description": "Manage the restaurant during the day, survive the darkness at night. There's more than just meat in this kitchen.",
